  m_Name: Donkey
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ItemDefinition
  itemID: donkey
  displayName: Donkey
  description: "The Donkey is a tired work horse of a gun, having changed hands several
    times over and now landing in yours. It is the very least collection of components
    required to still be considered a firearm but in the land of the blind, the one
    eyed man is king. The Donkey is not a combat weapon but a last resort in civil
    conflict; a deterrent. It\u2019ll keep you alive, but it won\u2019t win wars.\r\n(Stripped
    Winchester Model 1906 .22LR Pistol[Custom] [Scrap Tier Ranged Weapon])"
